    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Low tide, high body count...</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong></strong>Step into the shoes of a vacationer in the late 1990s, arriving at a quaint beach house in a small shore town along the New Jersey coast. You're here to meet up with three friends for a calm weekend getaway, but little do you know what horrors await...<br><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you arrive in this sleepy coastal town, you uncover a web of mystery and fear that will test your wits and nerves. Someone, or something, doesn't want you to be here...<br><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the atmospheric shore town to unravel its mysteries</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve first person inventory-based puzzles to progress the story</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with eccentric locals to gain useful information</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evade any threats by blending into shadows or sprinting for safety</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand crafted VHS / PS1 aesthetic with low poly graphics and retro sound design</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After only one autosave, you must find limited cassette tapes to save your progress</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Low tide, high body count...</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong></strong>Step into the shoes of a vacationer in the late 1990s, arriving at a quaint beach house in a small shore town along the New Jersey coast. You're here to meet up with three friends for a calm weekend getaway, but little do you know what horrors await...<br><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you arrive in this sleepy coastal town, you uncover a web of mystery and fear that will test your wits and nerves. Someone, or something, doesn't want you to be here...<br><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the atmospheric shore town to unravel its mysteries</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve first person inventory-based puzzles to progress the story</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with eccentric locals to gain useful information</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evade any threats by blending into shadows or sprinting for safety</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand crafted VHS / PS1 aesthetic with low poly graphics and retro sound design</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After only one autosave, you must find limited cassette tapes to save your progress</strong></p></li></ul>",
